Extracting exact quotation windows for the remaining answers.

```python
pages = {1:['reasoning–acting','three categories'],5:['Google Scholar','snowballing'],10:['Self Consistency','majority'],37:['inception prompting','stay in character'],47:['human evaluators'],51:['Training Data','Self reflection'],52:['benefit from reasoning','self-verification']}
r = run_command(["python","read_pdf.py","--start-page","1","--end-page","52"])
data = json.loads(r['stdout'])
txt = {p['page']:p['text'] for p in data['pages']}
for pg,kws in pages.items():
    t = txt[pg]
    for kw in kws:
        i = t.find(kw)
        print('PAGE',pg,'KW',kw,'at',i)
        if i>=0:
            print(t[max(0,i-600):i+500])
        print('---')
```
